title: "Herdr restart B ports: immediate clear epoch, drain earlier effect grants"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Result
    lg1: Restart
    lg2: Owner
    lg3: Breaks NoOldPaneInput
    lg4: Path to the NoOldPaneInput or RestartAvailable bug
    lg5: Repeats forever, so RestartAvailable breaks
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 purple
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  class lg5 repeats
  s0: Old session and a queued input
  s1: Seed committed#59; gate holds it
  s2: Restart holds the transition and fence
  s3: No seed admitted#59; restart goes on
  s4: Exact close confirmed#59; retire and settle
  s5: Old pane received an input while the restart was open
  s6: Old execution retired#59; exclusion still held
  s7: Exclusion released#59; reply pending
  s8: Owner turn began a launch
  s9: Seed waits for the owner
  s10: Owner turn installed Pending
  s11: Visible failure#59; inputs still owned
  s12: CheckEpoch observed#59; live BeginEffect still required
  s13: BeginEffect holds create authority
  s14: Create answered#59; first input not submitted
  s15: CheckEpoch observed#59; live input authority still required
  s16: BeginEffect holds input authority
  s17: First input submitted#59; receipt not committed
  s18: Receipt committed#59; source not bound
  s19: One new Ready session#59; inputs await the owner
  s20: One new Ready session#59; inputs settled once
  s21: New session without a greeting#59; inputs settled
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Commit the seed original (acceptance)
  s1 --> s2: Terminate takes transition and fence
  s1 --> s3: Permit refuses the seed with a notice
  s2 --> s4: Close only the captured pane
  s3 --> s2: Terminate takes transition and fence
  s3 --> s5: Submit an input to the still-current session
  s4 --> s6: Retire CAS and settle the old turn
  s6 --> s7: Disconnect keeping selector, release, wake
  s7 --> s8: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s7 --> s9: Reply to the command
  s8 --> s10: Install Pending over the vacant row
  s7 --> s11: Reply to the command
  s9 --> s8: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s10 --> s12: Observe the create epoch
  s11 --> s8: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s12 --> s13: Compare live epoch and retain create permission
  s13 --> s14: Complete the previously granted create
  s14 --> s15: Observe the input epoch
  s15 --> s16: Compare live epoch and retain input permission
  s16 --> s17: Complete the previously granted first input
  s17 --> s18: Commit the input's receipt
  s18 --> s19: Bind the source
  s19 --> s20: Submit an input to the successor once
  s18 --> s7: Bind the source
  s7 --> s21: Reply to the command
  s18 --> s21: Bind the source
